   │
<span class="c-cyn">③ 编排</span>   <span class="dim">并行扇出（Fan-out）</span>
   ├─▶ RPC <span class="c-grn">product.listProducts</span>(spuIds)      <span class="dim">── 基础商品信息</span>
   ├─▶ RPC <span class="c-grn">promotion.calcPrices</span>(userId,spuIds) <span class="dim">── 促销价</span>
   ├─▶ RPC <span class="c-grn">inventory.batchQuery</span>(spuIds)       <span class="dim">── 库存状态</span>
